<title>ROMANIA: Romania 7-mo current account deficit at $695 mln.</title>
<headline>Romania 7-mo current account deficit at $695 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Romania's current account deficit rose to $695 million over January-July from $520 million in the first six months this year but narrowed from $925 million a year ago, central bank data showed.</p>
<p> ROMANIAN CURRENT A/C	    JAN-JULY 96	    JAN-JULY 95</p>
<p> Current account (mln USD)	-695		     -925</p>
<p> Trade balance			-625		     -865</p>
<p> Exports (FOB)		     3,920		    4,440</p>
<p> Imports (FOB)		     4,545		    5,305</p>
<p> Services balance		    -87			-98</p>
<p> Income balance		     -173		     -110</p>
<p> Current transfers balance	 190			148</p>
<p>-- Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264</p>
</text>
